  </outputs>

  <acceptance-criteria>
    <criterion testable="true">The live probe obtained an owning-app token through the FIC from compute carrying the Worker UAMI, and the registration `GET` and the containers `GET` succeeded with it; the POML notes record the claims checked and each call's status (no token values). If not, the task stopped at escalation 1.</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">`SpeConfidentialClientGraphFactory` obtains owning-app tokens only through a UAMI-fed client assertion; no code path in L2 loads a certificate or secret for the owning app; `SpeContainerOptions` owner entries have no vault/secret properties.</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">H0: a run whose `containerTypeId` has an owner entry, a working token exchange and an existing registration passes the SPE check with no time gate; a run with no owner entry, a failed token exchange, or an unregistered container type is rejected Resumable with three distinct codes; `spe-cert-bootstrap-missing` no longer exists in code or current docs.</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">H13 T6: passes when the app-only containers listing for the container type succeeds and includes the run's container; fails (with its existing trap semantics) when the call is refused or the container is absent; no code calls app-only `GET /storage/fileStorage/containerTypes`.</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">Worker (dev) app settings contain `SpeContainerOptions__ContainerTypeOwners__0__ContainerTypeId` / `__OwnerAppId` with the Model 1 values and no `OwnerCert*` setting; checked-in JSON = fresh compile.</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">No Key Vault secret was created, deleted or purged; no federated credential other than `sprk-controlplane-dev-uami-assertion` exists on the owning app; any temporary probe resource was deleted.</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">ControlPlane projects build 0/0; ControlPlane.Tests no failures beyond the 6 T221 baseline; ArchTests pass (incl. CredentialGuardTests with no new allowlist entry).</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">Test scope: cover the credential factory's assertion path, owner-options validation, the H0 probe's pass + three rejection paths, and the T6 probe's pass + refused + container-absent paths. Anything beyond that needs a one-line justification in the POML notes.</criterion>
  </acceptance-criteria>

